    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fall Cat</strong>: a game where you play as a cat, who is immortal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall Cat has you fall down an <u>endless</u> building, with you attempting to <u>survive as long as possible</u>. Don't worry about causing harm to the cat, he's immortal and has nothing better to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge flower pots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hearts to regain health and boost your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four <strong><u>awesome</u></strong> songs (Composed by Calvin &quot;Yellow Flare&quot; Chan)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a little <u><i><strong>secret...</strong></i></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <u>pretty short</u>, and is meant to be a easy game to just pick up and play! Attempt to boost your score each time you play, possibly run into that little <u><i><strong>secret</strong></i></u>, and jam out to the sound track with surprisingly intense gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Fall Cat</strong>: a game where you play as a cat, who is immortal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall Cat has you fall down an <u>endless</u> building, with you attempting to <u>survive as long as possible</u>. Don't worry about causing harm to the cat, he's immortal and has nothing better to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge flower pots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bricks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hearts to regain health and boost your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four <strong><u>awesome</u></strong> songs (Composed by Calvin &quot;Yellow Flare&quot; Chan)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a little <u><i><strong>secret...</strong></i></u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extra Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <u>pretty short</u>, and is meant to be a easy game to just pick up and play! Attempt to boost your score each time you play, possibly run into that little <u><i><strong>secret</strong></i></u>, and jam out to the sound track with surprisingly intense gameplay.</p>",
